      "result_description": "Rainham CC, Essex - 4th XI - Win",
      "result_applied_to": "241235",
      "match_notes": "<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1d2228\">After&nbsp;constant&nbsp;checking&nbsp;of&nbsp;weather&nbsp;forecasts,&nbsp;a&nbsp;full&nbsp;scheduled&nbsp;cricket&nbsp;match&nbsp;took&nbsp;place&nbsp;at&nbsp;Oaklands.&nbsp;&nbsp;Match&nbsp;was&nbsp;played&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;&ldquo;cricketing&rdquo;&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;where&nbsp;all&nbsp;22&nbsp;players&nbsp;had&nbsp;a&nbsp;part&nbsp;to&nbsp;play&nbsp;where&nbsp;result&nbsp;was&nbsp;a&nbsp;by-product.&nbsp;&nbsp;There&nbsp;is&nbsp;nothing&nbsp;more&nbsp;satisfying,&nbsp;then&nbsp;22&nbsp;humans&nbsp;enjoying&nbsp;each&nbsp;other&rsquo;s&nbsp;company&nbsp;and&nbsp;encouraging&nbsp;each&nbsp;other.&nbsp;&nbsp;Going&nbsp;forward&nbsp;as&nbsp;weather&nbsp;improves&nbsp;I&nbsp;am&nbsp;hoping&nbsp;al&nbsp;matches&nbsp;are&nbsp;played&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;manner.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1d2228\">As&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;is&nbsp;concerned,&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;were&nbsp;put&nbsp;in&nbsp;and&nbsp;saw&nbsp;off&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;ball&nbsp;and&nbsp;managed&nbsp;to&nbsp;accumulate&nbsp;a&nbsp;large&nbsp;score&nbsp;thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;partnership&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;second&nbsp;wicket.&nbsp;In&nbsp;Bobby&nbsp;Little&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;batsman&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;likely&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;destined&nbsp;for&nbsp;higher&nbsp;playing&nbsp;Xi&rsquo;s&nbsp;and&nbsp;he&nbsp;used&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;to&nbsp;progress&nbsp;his&nbsp;credentials&nbsp;supported&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;skipper.&nbsp;&nbsp;Oaklands&nbsp;got&nbsp;off&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;slow&nbsp;start,&nbsp;denting&nbsp;their&nbsp;slim&nbsp;chances&nbsp;of&nbsp;victory&nbsp;however&nbsp;a&nbsp;late&nbsp;order&nbsp;flurry&nbsp;ensured&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;enjoyed&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n",
